# Video Studio — environment variables (hosting dashboard env vars)
#
# Ye file sirf ek NAMOONA hai — ismein koi asli key mat likhna.
# Asli values DeployVera panel mein service ke "Environment Variables"
# section mein daalni hain (naam bilkul aisa hi hona chahiye).
# Env vars badalne ke baad service restart karni padti hai.
#
# Bina keys ke bhi server chalta hai, lekin:
#   - Google keys ke bina login nahi hoga ("login not configured yet")
#   - Abhi free launch hai: koi payment nahi, download muft hai.
#     Razorpay keys baad mein lagenge jab payment shuru hoga.

# --- Google login (zaroori — bina iske koi video nahi bana sakta) ---
# Google Cloud Console (console.cloud.google.com) -> apna project ->
# "OAuth consent screen" bharo -> "Credentials" -> "Create Credentials" ->
# "OAuth client ID" (Web application).
# Authorized redirect URI mein ye daalo:
#   https://video-studio-a04252.apps.deployvera.com/auth/callback
# (ya apna custom domain ho to: https://<aapka-domain>/auth/callback)
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI=

# --- Session secret (koi bhi lamba random string, jaise 64 hex characters) ---
# Ise kabhi kisi se share mat karna. Badalne par sabhi logins logout ho jayenge.
# Generate karne ke liye: python3 -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
SESSION_SECRET=

# --- Razorpay payment (BAAD MEIN — abhi free launch hai) ---
# Abhi payment band hai, isliye ye keys zaroori nahi hain. Jab payment
# lagana ho tab: Razorpay Dashboard -> Settings -> API Keys, pehle TEST
# keys se shuru karo ("Test Mode" on); live ke liye KYC ke baad live keys.
# RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
# RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=

# --- Stock footage (optional lekin recommended) ---
# Apni Pixabay API key yahan secret ke roop mein daalo — isse videos mein
# asli stock footage aati hai (bina key ke Wikimedia Commons + AI images
# istemaal hote hain, jo kaam to karte hain lekin footage kam milti hai).
# Key pixabay.com -> login -> API docs page par milti hai.
PIXABAY_API_KEY=

# Pexels API key (optional; Pexels ne nayi keys dena abhi rok rakha hai —
# jab dobara mile to yahan daal sakte ho).
PEXELS_API_KEY=
